      "message": "If the issue is upstream, then it needs to go upstream first.\n\nIf it is not relevant for upstream, but relevant for the 5.10 stable tree, then it needs to be sent to the stable tree maintainers upstream.\n\nIf this is only touching android-specific code that has only been added to this specific branch, then that needs to be documented really really well here so that we can understand the issues involved better.\n\nthanks!",
